abstract: >-
  N^2 is a Python package that unifies nearest neighbor methods for scalar and
  distributional matrix completion behind a single interface, together with
  N^2-Bench, a benchmark suite of real-world matrix completion tasks spanning
  mobile health, recommender systems, causal panel data, and large language
  model evaluation.
